<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy Birthday Shrabani ❤️</title>

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff4e8a,#7b2ff7);
    height:100vh;
    overflow:hidden;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}

.card{
    width:90%;
    max-width:650px;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);
    backdrop-filter:blur(15px);
    border-radius:20px;
    padding:40px;
    text-align:center;
    color:white;
    box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(255,255,255,.3);
}

h1{
    font-size:45px;
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

p{
    font-size:20px;
    line-height:1.8;
}

button{
    margin-top:25px;
    padding:15px 35px;
    border:none;
    border-radius:40px;
    font-size:18px;
    cursor:pointer;
    background:white;
    color:#ff2e63;
    transition:.3s;
}

button:hover{
    transform:scale(1.08);
}

#message{
    display:none;
    animation:fade 2s;
}

@keyframes fade{
    from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);}
    to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}
}

.heart{
    position:absolute;
    color:#ff1744;
    font-size:25px;
    animation:fly linear forwards;
}

@keyframes fly{
    from{
        transform:translateY(100vh);
        opacity:1;
    }
    to{
        transform:translateY(-100px);
        opacity:0;
    }
}
</style>

</head>
<body>

<div class="card">

<h1>🎂 Happy Birthday ❤️</h1>

<h2>Shrabani 🌹</h2>

<p>Born on <b>05/07/2002</b></p>

<button onclick="showLove()">Open My Surprise ❤️</button>

<div id="message">

<h2 style="margin-top:25px;">💖 For You 💖</h2>

<p>
Dear <b>Shrabani</b>, ❤️<br><br>

On your special day, I just want to remind you how precious you are.
You bring happiness, peace and countless beautiful moments into my life.

Every smile of yours makes my day brighter,
and every moment with you becomes a memory I'll always cherish.

May your life always be filled with love, success and endless happiness.

✨ Happy Birthday, My Love. ✨

I Love You Forever ❤️
</p>

</div>

</div>

<script>

function showLove(){

document.getElementById("message").style.display="block";

for(let i=0;i<120;i++){

let heart=document.createElement("div");

heart.className="heart";

heart.innerHTML="❤";

heart.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";

heart.style.animationDuration=(3+Math.random()*4)+"s";

heart.style.fontSize=(15+Math.random()*30)+"px";

document.body.appendChild(heart);

setTimeout(()=>{
heart.remove();
},7000);

}

}

</script>

</body>
</html>

